abstract: "ClassicalGuitarOntology is an ontology for curriculum-based classical guitar education. The current recommended release, v1.6.0, represents all six curriculum levels and provides the authoritative frozen OWL 2 DL baseline together with a separately validated SWRL supplement, compact formal-validation evidence, and representative reasoning documentation. Earlier public releases are preserved as version-specific historical records."